{"id":"655415","name":"葱香青菜云吞","author":"爱在夏郢","authorId":"11343633","desc":"","cover":"images/655415/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"云吞","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"青菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"青菜和葱洗干净。","img":"images/655415/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"葱切段。","img":"images/655415/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅下油。","img":"images/655415/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入葱段爆香。","img":"images/655415/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入生抽、白糖、蚝油，关火。","img":"images/655415/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把葱段装出来放碗里。","img":"images/655415/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅里加水。","img":"images/655415/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烧开后放入青菜，加点盐。","img":"images/655415/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮熟青菜。","img":"images/655415/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"青菜和汤倒出来放刚刚装葱段的碗里。","img":"images/655415/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"另外烧水煮云吞。","img":"images/655415/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"云吞煮熟后捞出来放入青菜和汤的碗里。","img":"images/655415/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"喜欢可以再加点辣椒。","img":"images/655415/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}